    <briefdescription>
<para>Test suite for the doubly-linked list (t_dlist) implementation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>pulgamecanica (arosado-)</para>
</simplesect>
Covers ft_dlstnew(), ft_dlstadd_back(), ft_dlstsize().</para>
<para>Forward and backward traversal via <computeroutput>-&gt;next</computeroutput> / <computeroutput>-&gt;prev</computeroutput>, and ft_dlstclear().</para>
<para>This suite is always compiled and always runs — it is not guarded by a feature flag because <computeroutput>t_list</computeroutput> is a core Libft primitive. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
